* ''Commons Computer.'' A shared Cloudron install on one Hostinger server, pooling compute and admin help for DWebYVR, Z-Space, ATProtocol Dev and Tools for Thought Rocks; begun 2023-10-15, relaunched January 2025; funding and pricing unstated. SOURCED (https://tangled.org/bmann.ca/bmannconsulting.com/blob/archivetrim/_notes/Commons%20Computer.md).
