* ''Where he writes.'' The blog index lists posts for 2025 and 2026 and moved much of its feed to atproto-hosted posts. SOURCED (https://bmannconsulting.com/blog). Titles in 2026 run: "TLDs for thee and me" (Oct 6), "Rainbows End" (Sep 25), "LaSuite Apps + Atmosphere Accounts" (Sep 19), "Building GhostOff" (Jul 4), "BMC Next with Agentic Coding" (Jun 29). SOURCED.
